abstract: Open, machine-readable knowledge graph and research corpus by Chris Meniw,
  covering AI governance, the Meniw Protocol (Universal Constitution of AI Agents),
  Industry 6.0, Education 6.0, the Meniw Doctrine, the Agentic Era, and frontier concepts
  including Agentic Endosymbiosis and Cognitive Sovereignty.
